{"ai_route":{"actual_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","ai_run_id":"airun_20261010040630_56852c0e","expected_response_model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","fallback_chain_id":"aifb_1b385d5a9055eb41d0fae426","fallback_depth":0,"fallback_reason":"","model":"mtplx-flash-next-optimized-speed","provider":"mtplx","reasoning_effort":"xhigh","route_base_url":"http://127.0.0.1:8002/v1","route_identity_hash":"c9480819205db8521fec70763515cf905334434da194fa8ae2172b40ab545075","route_profile_id":"independent_ai__mtplx_qwen38_local","thinking":"enabled"},"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010040630_56852c0e","chunk_index":6,"job_id":"mwjob_5c7cad7eae0ca0b22790c68a","precondition_digest":"2b84d56f7381ab57badd218418ca3197033eba48f09fde31a83dc955f19a788a","project_id":"proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f","schema_version":"protocol_full_draft_chunk_v10","section_ids":["mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_18113dd95d90b984","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_4edf67e4e6016bb8","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_548a722ae96b5bf1","mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_d1915fd612e832a2"],"sections":[{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010040630_56852c0e","content_status":"complete","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"试验药物：KRX-203片","quote_sha256":"639197f13496980dd95a98ff4aa080b8e2dcea6e002ec4a68d0dc85e1c77ea7d","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_drug_basic"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"剂量与给药方案：KRX-203片：0.25mg BID（每日两次，每次1片，0.25mg规格）；0.5mg BID（每日两次，每次1片，0.5mg规格）；疗程8周；无负荷剂量","quote_sha256":"154f8b5a4e8fa09b8d19a30b40028494140ff625f6dd8c5e40bf7f15aa4d0221","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_dose_regimen"},{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:revision:9","quote":"安慰剂：安慰剂组（与0.25mg BID、0.5mg BID按1:1:1随机分配）","quote_sha256":"8d3e7b94f23bb216cf1a75ba99ac8e6057833a04e72945e1d3c4ae9a59b073cd","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492","span_id":"es_placebo"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_drug_basic","es_dose_regimen","es_placebo"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":3},"gap_items":[],"heading":"研究药物信息","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究的试验药物为KRX-203片，属小分子化学药物，作用机制为外周限制性κ阿片受体激动剂。KRX-203片为薄膜衣片，规格为0.25mg和0.5mg（以游离碱计），给药途径为口服。给药方案为每日两次（BID），每次1片，随餐或空腹服用，无负荷剂量，治疗疗程为8周。本研究设置两个活性剂量组（0.25mg BID和0.5mg BID）及一个安慰剂对照组，三组按1:1:1比例随机分配。安慰剂为与KRX-203片外观、气味、味道一致的匹配安慰剂片，给药频率与活性药物相同。试验药物及安慰剂均由申办方提供。","rationale":"药物名称、剂型、规格、给药途径、剂量方案、疗程、随机比例及安慰剂匹配信息均来源于当前项目已确认研究事实（R4A-KRX-203第1.0版）。需医学经理确认：（1）规格以游离碱计是否需补充盐形式信息；（2）安慰剂匹配描述是否需进一步细化外观参数；（3）药物来源描述是否需补充供应商或生产场地信息。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_18113dd95d90b984","section_number":"6.1.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:fed0a13282797005572145db","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010040630_56852c0e","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取药物制备工艺文件、包装规格说明、标签模板、储存条件及有效期数据、药物管理SOP","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_612_packaging","missing_source_classes":["药物制备工艺文件","包装规格与形式说明","标签内容要求","储存条件与有效期数据","药物管理SOP"],"target":"6.1.2 制备、包装、标签、储存与管理"}],"heading":"制备、包装、标签、储存与管理","missing_source_classes":["药物制备工艺文件","包装规格与形式说明","标签内容要求","储存条件与有效期数据"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要药物制备工艺、包装形式与规格、标签内容、储存条件及有效期、药物管理规程等项目文件方可撰写。当前允许来源仅确认剂型为薄膜衣片、规格0.25mg/0.5mg、药物来源为申办方提供，未包含制备、包装、标签、储存或管理的具体实施规则，无法形成有实质信息的正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_4edf67e4e6016bb8","section_number":"6.1.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:fed0a13282797005572145db","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010040630_56852c0e","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取药物发放流程、回收程序、清点频率与记录方式、药物 accountability 表格模板","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_613_dispensing","missing_source_classes":["药物发放流程文件","回收程序说明","清点频率与记录方式","药物 accountability 表格模板"],"target":"6.1.3 发放、回收与清点"}],"heading":"发放、回收与清点","missing_source_classes":["药物发放流程文件","回收程序说明","清点频率与记录方式","药物 accountability 表格模板"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要药物发放流程、回收程序、清点频率与记录方式、药物 accountability 表格等项目文件方可撰写。当前允许来源未包含任何关于药物发放、回收或清点的具体实施规则，无法形成有实质信息的正文。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_ad1ab8acc74f_548a722ae96b5bf1","section_number":"6.1.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:fed0a13282797005572145db","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_dd1f824d61cf7b35fc07:r9:e734f05c4d419492"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261010040630_56852c0e","content_status":"source_gap","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":[],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"获取剂量调整触发条件（含AE分级阈值）、暂停与恢复标准、永久停药标准、剂量调整审批流程","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_63_dose_adjust","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整触发条件与阈值","剂量暂停与恢复标准","永久停药标准","剂量调整审批流程"],"target":"6.3 剂量调整、暂停、恢复与永久停药"}],"heading":"剂量调整、暂停、恢复与永久停药","missing_source_classes":["剂量调整触发条件与阈值","剂量暂停与恢复标准","永久停药标准","剂量调整审批流程"],"proposal_text":"","rationale":"本章节需要剂量调整触发条件（如不良事件分级阈值）、剂量暂停与恢复标准、永久停药标准、剂量调整审批流程等项